SUMMARY:Get Lost with Sherry!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMeetup Location: Fallbrook Tr
 ail and 27th Side road\, Silver Creek Conservation\, Halton Hills\n\nI lov
 e getting lost in the woods\, and by chance it is my speciality. Let's get
  lost together this Sunday on the bruce Trail! You might be surprised at h
 ow much fun it is.\nThis moderate loop follows both the main Bruce Trail a
 nd some side trails - perfect places to get lost! There is a variety of tr
 ails and nice stretches along the creek. There are also lots of roots and 
 rocks on the trail\, so make sure you are wearing proper footwear!\n\nPlen
 ty of free parking along the road near the trail entrance
