SUMMARY:Halloween Dance Party and Scavenger Hunt
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**It's a Halloween Dance Part
 y and Scavenger Hunt!**\n\n**Location: Party Room 51 Trolley Crescent**\n*
 *(Scavenger Hunt is under the bridge)**\n\n**Fee:**\n**20 by October 19th*
 *******\n**25 from October 20th to 28th\n**Send to**\n**boots4hikingthesix
 @gmail.com**\n\n**Party Details**\n***Theme**: Unmask your hidden self.*\n
 *** Vibe*: Grown-up drinks\, killer costumes\, and zero filters.\n\n**Drop
  the mask and let your true monster out to play this Halloween.**\nPrize f
 or best costume!\nEvery day we wear the mask of the professional\, the pol
 ite\, and the responsible. Not tonight. This Halloween\, it’s time to sh
 ed your civilized skin and unleash your **real personality**—no filters\
 , no judgements\, just pure\, unadulterated fun.\nCome as who you *actuall
 y* are on the inside.\n🖤 The Ritual\n\n*** Date: **Saturday\, October 3
 1st\, 2026\n*** Time: **7:00 PM until the spirits fade**\n*** Lair: We are
  just confirming the venue. We will keep you posted!\n\n🍷 The Elements\
 n\n*** Potions & Brews: **Drinks and nibbles provided!\n*** Attire: **Cost
 umes required. Dress as your inner alter-ego\, your deepest obsession\, or
  the version of you that only comes out after dark.\n*** The Vibe: **Dark 
 beats\, heavy pours\, and wicked company.\nADMISSION IS $20\,\n\nAre you b
 rave enough to show your true colours?
