SUMMARY: Practical Philosophy Social!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nGet to know your fellow hiker
 s more intimately with a night of Practical Philosophy.\n\nIn partnership 
 with the Practical Philosophy Meetup I thought it would be a fun a social 
 !\n**How does it work?**\nWe select a topic like monogomy vs pologomy and 
 in groups of 6-8 with a moderator (so conservations are respectful)\nten q
 uestions are asked and everyone has a chance to give their take on the sub
 ject.\nGet to know your fellow hikers on a deeper level! You may be surpri
 sed!\n**Opposing views are of course welcome!**\nLocation to be determined
 !
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/these-boots-are-made-for-hiking/event
 s/316483006/
